WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.740
Screaming

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.640
To your knowledge, did your father have any enemies?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.960
Shall I repeat the question?

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.640
- No, I heard you. 
- Then please answer.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.940
The new housemaid, ma'am.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.840
It's Bridget.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.940
My name's Lizzie.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.620
Do you find your room comfortable? It can get quite hot up there.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.620
Sometimes it's best to leave the door open.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.860
It's alright, girl.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:52.080
Father, have you done something?

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:55.520
Have I done something?

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.140
Eat, Lizzie. I said you will eat.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.700
No!

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.020
You would apologize to your mother.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:06.020
Don't you dare call her my mother.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:15.320
Do you need my help? 
You have it.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.520
You should be certain if you say that.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.520
I am.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.920
Lizzie Andrew Borden.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:31.349
Please place your right hand on the Bible before you.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:38.089
Do you swear before Almighty God to tell the truth on all matters pertaining to the murder of Andrew and Abby Borden?

00:01:38.089 --> 00:01:45.420
[Screams]

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.020
Are you afraid?

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.300
Of what?

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.040
To your knowledge, did your father have any enemies?

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.660
This is America, sir, every man with a pulse has enemies.

